# ==============================================================================
# PX4 PARAMETER EXPORT FILE (QGroundControl Ready)
# ==============================================================================
#
# Hey there! This is a standardized PX4 parameter file for our bi-copter.
#
# How to use this in QGroundControl:
# 1. Connect your drone (or launch SITL simulation).
# 2. In QGroundControl, click the "Q" icon -> Vehicle Setup (Gears icon) -> Parameters.
# 3. Click "Tools" in the top right corner -> "Load from file...".
# 4. Select this file (`bicopter.params`).
# 5. Click "Reboot Vehicle" when prompted.
#
# All actuator geometry, servo tilt mappings, and flight PID gains will be
# loaded into the autopilot instantly!
# ==============================================================================
